<section class="section wrap"><h2>Evidence Classification</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><span class="label">LEVEL A</span><h3>Primary documented evidence</h3><p>Authenticated original records, official documents, court material, verified media, or direct statements.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">LEVEL B</span><h3>Strong independent reporting</h3><p>Multiple credible reports, established investigations, academic work, or verified testimony.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">LEVEL C</span><h3>Corroborated circumstantial evidence</h3><p>Confirmed attendance, relationships, financial links, shared organizations, or recurring activity that does not by itself prove the stronger allegation.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">LEVEL D</span><h3>Unverified allegation</h3><p>Anonymous claims, unsupported testimony, unauthenticated screenshots, or claims without original documentation.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">LEVEL E</span><h3>Symbolic interpretation</h3><p>Clothing, colors, gestures, numerology, artistic imagery, mythology, or visual resemblance.</p></article><article class="card"><span class="label">LEVEL F</span><h3>Unsupported or refuted</h3><p>Manipulated media, false quotations, wrong identities, incorrect dates, disproven stories, or claims with no traceable source.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section wrap split"><article class="card redline"><h2>Case-File Standard</h2><p>Break viral collages and compilations into individual cases. Record the original source, publication date, person or organization, location, alleged meaning, documented circumstances, public response, supporting evidence, contradicting evidence, confidence grade, editorial status, and last review date.</p><p>Do not create a membership list from symbols, clothes, injuries, gestures, attendance, numerology, or association alone.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Evidence Drop</h2><p>Submit verifiable evidence, original sources, corrections, or alternative explanations. Do not submit threats, private addresses, stolen credentials, illegal material, private victim identities, or unsupported accusations.</p><a class="btn" href="dark-speculation-forum.html?investigation=hand-signs-gesture-archive#submit-signal">Open Evidence Drop For Hand Signs and Gesture Archive</a></article></section>
